 "sentences": [
  "Gravitational waves could reveal hidden alien worlds.",
  "NASA’s future LISA observatory will track ripples in space-time caused by orbiting masses.",
  "It targets double white dwarf systems, which emit nearly continuous gravitational signals.",
  "If a planet orbits these binaries, it creates a wobble, leaving a detectable imprint.",
  "LISA expects to find about 10,000 of these systems.",
  "Then, the James Webb telescope can confirm these distant, newly discovered exoplanets."
